        "isCorrect": false,
        "distractorType": "CONCEPT_DISTORTION",
        "distractorDisplayName": "偷换概念",
        "analysis": "【偷换概念】原文是官员利用群体动力（group dynamics）来推动同辈压力，逻辑方向被颠倒混淆。",
