        "distractorDisplayName": "正确答案",
        "analysis": "【正确项 · 同义上位概括】对应首段第3句：It usually leads to no good -- drinking, drugs and casual sex。leads to 对应 a cause of；no good 以及 drinking, drugs and casual sex（酗酒、吸毒、滥交）被精确上位概括为 undesirable behaviors（不良行为）。",
