    "verbatimEvidence": "That whispered message, half invitation and half forcing, is what most of us think of when we hear the words peer pressure. It usually leads to no good -- drinking, drugs and casual sex.",
    "synonymMapping": [
      {
        "verbatimText": "leads to no good -- drinking, drugs and casual sex",
        "equivalentOption": "a cause of undesirable behaviors"
      }
    ],
    "methodologyReview": {
